    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4986" root="جبل" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبْلَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبِلَّةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also The <i>origin,</i> or <i>stock,</i>
(K, TA,) of any created thing; (TA;) and so
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبُلَّةٌ</span></b> . (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The <i>fundamental nature,</i>
or <i>composition,</i> of a mountain. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوْبٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيِّدُ الجِبْلَةِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A garment,</i> or <i>piece of cloth, good
in respect of the thread</i> (K, TA) <i>and the weaving.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ ذُو جِبْلَةٍ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>A big, thick, coarse,</i> or
<i>rough, man.</i> (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبِلٌّ</span>, in two
places: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبْلَةٌ</span>.

